  speakerName: "Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \xE1o x\xE1m"
  portrait: {fileID: 748173949620142643, guid: d9cd513cc127c82479931333a891b8db, type: 3}
  continuePrompt: "Nh\u1EA5n C \u0111\u1EC3 ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c"
  closePrompt: "Nh\u1EA5n C \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\xF3ng"
  lines:
  - english: The town can read again, and its people may leave. But who will remember
      Lexi?
    vietnamese: "Th\u1ECB tr\u1EA5n \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u1ECDc \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      ch\u1EEF, v\xE0 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi d\xE2n c\xF3 th\u1EC3 r\u1EDDi \u0111i. Nh\u01B0ng
      ai s\u1EBD nh\u1EDB Lexi?"
  - english: Goodbye does not mean forgetting.
    vietnamese: "... 'Goodbye' kh\xF4ng c\xF3 ngh\u0129a l\xE0 qu\xEAn."
